%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%Pages: 2
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 200 100
%%EndComments
%%Page: 1 1
<< /PageSize [200 100] >> setpagedevice
1 0 0 setrgbcolor 10 10 80 80 rectfill
/Times-Roman findfont 20 scalefont setfont 0 setgray 100 40 moveto (Ipsum) show
showpage
%%Page: 2 2
0 0 1 setrgbcolor 110 10 80 80 rectfill
0 1 0 setrgbcolor 3 setlinewidth newpath 10 50 moveto 50 90 lineto 90 50 lineto stroke
showpage
%%EOF
